{"id":"0cefcc7942834ee1","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength.md","title":"KF与VF强度不等价","display":"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength — KF与VF强度不等价","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength","aliases":["91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength","91-cor-KF-VF-strength","91-cor-VF-KF-equal"],"display":"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength — KF与VF强度不等价","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-VF]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength</span><span>91-cor-KF-VF-strength</span><span>91-cor-VF-KF-equal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength — KF与VF强度不等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength-—-KF-与-VF-强度不等价\">cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength — KF 与 VF 强度不等价</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (标准 Kripke–Feferman 理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> (Cantini 的超赋值真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> (迭代至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下的分层真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> (一个正归纳定义理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (共同的算术后果类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>\n(算术后果等价, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>\n(算术后果严格包含)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}VF\\text{-}equivalent\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}VF\\text{-}equivalent\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二者都与语义固定点有关，并不意味着证明论等价。标准 KF 的算术后果\n对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下的分层真理迭代；VF 则达到一个正归纳定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 的强度。因此原来的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{KF}|=|\\mathrm{VF}|=\\Gamma_0\">\\(|\\mathrm{KF}|=|\\mathrm{VF}|=\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 与逐句可证性等价均不成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength-—-KF-与-VF-强度不等价","text":"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength — KF 与 VF 强度不等价","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}$\n(算术后果等价, see [[91-df-truth-strength]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}VF\\text{-}equivalent\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathrm{KF}|=|\\mathrm{VF}|=\\Gamma_0","display":false}],"bytes":1565,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["a0a2284f96eaea1d","669ee474b9646a38","c87db4d1858a0009"]}